  "details": "At the bottom of the home page \"Hey, Have You Seen This Completely Random World?\" when clicking the \"Load More Worlds\" it fails after the 5th world. The index goes 01, 011, 0111, 01111 and finally crashes at 011111.\n\nThis is most likely due to it being incorrectly parsed as a string and JS therefore does append rather than increment. The endpoint then fails due to the index being higher than the max limit of 10,000. This generates a Cloudflare HTTP 1020 Access Denied error and causes the button to load forever.",
